OL,3,GNEWSAWar veteran returns Falklands
OL,4,Ahelmet to Argentina
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former Royal Marine has reunited with
OL,7,Fan Argentine veteran to return a helmet
OL,8,Fhe "borrowed" during a battle in the
OL,9,FFalklands War.
OL,11,FRoyal Marine Andy Gatrick, who was 18
OL,12,Fat the time, came across two injured
OL,13,FArgentine soldiers during the Battle of
OL,14,FMount Harriet in 1982.
OL,16,FThe helmet belonging to one of the men,
OL,17,Fboth of whom were captured by the
OL,18,FMarines, had a name on it: Hector.
OL,19,FGatrick, now 63, managed to track him
OL,20,Fdown and flew back on 23 October to
OL,21,Freturn it.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
