OL,3,GNEWSAWar veteran returns Falklands
OL,4,Ahelmet to Argentina
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe was joined by Mick Dawson, another
OL,7,FRoyal Marine veteran from Rottingdean,
OL,8,FEast Sussex, who filmed the exchange
OL,9,Ffor a new documentary called Hector's
OL,10,FHelmet.
